@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam ArrowColor #526B7B
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #DFF1EF
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam sequenceActorBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #9AAEB7
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #7B919E
skinparam sequenceDividerBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF3DF
skinparam noteBorderColor #B99557
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
hide footbox
autonumber
title SB-M10 — Invitation acceptance and resource-scoped changed access
actor Invitee as U
actor "Resource owner" as O
participant "Resource authority / invitation" as A
participant "Intended resource" as R
U -> A : Request acceptance of intended invitation
A -> A : Check scope, eligibility and current invitation state
alt Ineligible or acceptance not confirmed
 A --> U : Rejected / actual unconfirmed result; no effective grant claim
else Eligible acceptance confirmed
 A --> U : Confirmed scoped membership
 U -> R : Request intended resource action
 R -> A : Evaluate current actor / resource / action / state
 alt Current grant permits action
  A --> R : Permitted scoped context
  R --> U : Actual permitted result
 else Not permitted / unrelated target
  A --> R : Denied
  R --> U : No protected action / content
 end
end
opt Owner separately changes membership
 O -> A : Request authorized grant change
 A --> O : Actual effective / failed change result
 U -> R : Make a later protected request
 R -> A : Re-evaluate applicable current authority
 A --> R : Current permit / deny result
 R --> U : Corresponding scoped outcome
end
note over A,R
No unrelated private-data grant follows membership.
Existing/in-flight request policy is not settled by this figure.
end note
legend bottom
Logical domain interaction, not runtime execution evidence.
Detailed proposed guards/policies retain their primary status.
endlegend
@enduml
